notes.content:
-  [b]Barbarian[/b]: HP regeneration points increased from 1 every 5 to 10 seconds to 3 to 6 every 5 to 10 seconds;
-  [b]Archer[/b]: starting at level 10, will gain the ability to shoot without consuming arrows;
-  [b]Elemental Atmosphere[/b]: damage that was 1 to 5 HP over 5 to 10 seconds has been increased to 5 to 10 HP;
-  [b]Empty Papyrus[/b]: available for purchase in the potions column at the GUILD;
-  [b]Ruins [/b]image adjustment;
- Implementation of the [b]Runes of Power[/b], which will only be available in new maps/worlds that you create.

