- Added hero deletion confirmation message;
- Added item: Empty Papyrus;
- Created the "Papyrus" shop, for crafting scrolls using compounds and an empty papyrus --> New Maps;
- Created the Spinning Chain trap ---> New Maps (starting from level 3);
- Trap and lever frequency: small adjustment for the appearance of traps from easy to heroic levels.

