-  Critical hit adjusted from a hit of 1/20 to 1/10;
-  Door HP points adjusted from 1 to 5 to 1 to 4;
-  New rendering support adjustment: 8k (4320p), 4K (2160p), QHD (1440p), Full HD (1080p), HD (720p) ===> minimum: 1280x720;
-  Enabled navigation and movement using Numpad keys: 2, 4, 5, 6, and 8, for those using a Keyboard;
-  Adjusted information regarding keyboard/controller commands;
-  Adjusted the frequency of finding Eternal HP and MP potions in chests;
-  Created a menu for accessing Controls in the game's main panel.

